# Backtest Reports Directory

This directory will contain:
- Backtest HTML reports from MT5 Strategy Tester
- Trade CSV exports
- Metrics comparison tables
- Equity curve charts

## Expected Files After Phase 1 Backtest:
- Variant_A_2020_2024.html
- Variant_B_2020_2024.html
- Variant_C_2020_2024.html
- Variant_D_2020_2024.html
- Variant_A_trades.csv
- Variant_B_trades.csv
- Variant_C_trades.csv
- Variant_D_trades.csv
- Comparison_Matrix.xlsx
